{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our demo is now online. Welcome to join the QQ group. We look forward to your joining Discord. If you have any comments or suggestions, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:1820238869@qq.com\">1820238869@qq.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About the map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed with 3 chapters. The starting point of the story is the Kingdom of Dust in Chapter 1, and the Vast Branches in Chapter 2. Players face the choice of route, choose to go to the human world, the demon world or the divine world. In the third chapter, there will be three corresponding maps. Players will unlock different endings after completing the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/915c5b832eb1200a9d5ace23c1e65e84.avif?t=1770002175\" width=598 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About the role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character rotation mechanism is our core gameplay. Players' choices determine the attribute growth of the two characters, who is the protector and the protected, or who can grow together to defeat the enemy. We designed four kinds of relationships: family, friends, lovers, people and nature, and created the characters of the game. We hope that everyone can experience the fun of the game and also feel the emotional resonance. Walk with me, with you by my side, and with each other who I trust most, what difficulties are there that cannot be overcome?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/2a8c1417a35cf8b7a01467b38ebaacd2.poster.avif?t=1770002175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/2a8c1417a35cf8b7a01467b38ebaacd2.webm?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/2a8c1417a35cf8b7a01467b38ebaacd2.mp4?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strong enemies on the road</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Currently, &quot;Egg of Lies&quot; and &quot;Shadow of the Unknown&quot; have been produced, appearing at the end of the Kingdom of Dust. &quot;Egg of Lies&quot; confuses people's hearts. Keep your heart and don't be greedy. You can defeat it step by step. &quot;Shadow of the Unknown&quot; you have to attack bravely, and the brave will win when they meet on a narrow road. We want to keep more bosses secret and look forward to meeting you in the full version. You can also join the group to follow our latest progress. &quot;Egg of Lies&quot; &quot;Shadow of the Unknown&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Egg of Lies&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/26a0fee749d4ea39df7bdde90c6b42d9.poster.avif?t=1770002175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/26a0fee749d4ea39df7bdde90c6b42d9.webm?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/26a0fee749d4ea39df7bdde90c6b42d9.mp4?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Shadow of the Unknown&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/fcc20013e863a9043ccfa6aff6dcb835.poster.avif?t=1770002175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/fcc20013e863a9043ccfa6aff6dcb835.webm?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/fcc20013e863a9043ccfa6aff6dcb835.mp4?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capybara, our beloved mascot, make an appearance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/c411e58f5292392129d3ce87cea3d90a.poster.avif?t=1770002175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/c411e58f5292392129d3ce87cea3d90a.webm?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/extras/c411e58f5292392129d3ce87cea3d90a.mp4?t=1770002175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, I hope you can support our new team, and we will work hard to make games that everyone can enjoy! !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030230?t=1770002175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030230?t=1770002175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/d6e3ad7ad50c052db05f685223b74b2d63e37327/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770002175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030230/d6e3ad7ad50c052db05f685223b74b2d63e37327/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770002175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_desc